            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "Requirements",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " The other member of the crew has Readied to Stride on your order; ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "Effect",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " You and the other crew member Stride, with a maximum distance equal to the slowest crew member's Speed, then make a melee Strike with the ram against a structure or an unattended, stationary object. This Strike deals bludgeoning damage equal to 2d8 + the highest Strength modifier among members of the crew.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
